German frontend
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
The German rules (crates/nrmlz/src/de/) are a Rust translation of the German
text frontend of Articulino-DE-EN-Realtime-Stream-TTS:

  Articulino-DE-EN-Realtime-Stream-TTS
