  https://huggingface.co/eigenhand/Articulino-DE-EN-Realtime-Stream-TTS-ONNX
  https://github.com/eigenhand/articulino-onnx

Pinned upstream revision: Hugging Face a760ce8d513534111c7679751869fa4c45ef0e54
(articulino-onnx 1.0.0), file articulino_onnx/frontend/german.py,
sha256 5b95a317521bfdf865c580bc85f20b7ecf4ac07381c6e9f1040ba6e51da100f5.

Changes: the Python code was translated to Rust (modified files, see the
header of each module). The data tables crates/nrmlz/data/de/abbreviations.json
(sha256 289b5b80ebcf7cf18839f32fbf9421beb7ee90908ee1c272ad0bd7f4acc8b0ac) and
crates/nrmlz/data/de/units.json
(sha256 45b4300f16607ab6c960adad29bc86295d306fab891e9fadeaa41efc441d79c4)
are copied unchanged. The training-data attributions in the upstream NOTICE
concern the model weights, which nrmlz does not contain.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Number words
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
The German number words reproduce the output of num2words 0.5.14 (LGPL-2.1),
which the upstream frontend calls. nrmlz contains no num2words code: the
spelling is implemented independently and checked against the library's output.
